env/*

# Raw judge responses carry the real judge codes and unredacted free text: keep local only.
# Only the anonymised copies under reports/anonymised/ (judges relabelled J1..J5 per domain,
# one self-identifying passage redacted) are published. See README.md.
reports/**/*.csv
reports/**/*.ipynb
!reports/anonymised/
!reports/anonymised/**/*.csv
